# Seasoned Cryomancer: two nonland cards discarded make "up to two target creatures", but the only creature is the
# Cryomancer itself. The ability still goes on the stack with the targets there are (CR 603.3d: "up to" needs none),
# and the Cryomancer taps itself and gets the stun counter; on Bot1's next untap step the counter comes off instead
# (CR 122.1d).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Island
Black Lotus
Seasoned Cryomancer
Lightning Bolt
Brainstorm
Island
Island
Force of Will
Dark Ritual
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Seasoned Cryomancer.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt; Brainstorm)
Bot1.Target(Seasoned Cryomancer)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Seasoned Cryomancer.Tapped = true
? Bot1.Battlefield.Seasoned Cryomancer.Counters.Stun = 1
[T5 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Seasoned Cryomancer.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Seasoned Cryomancer.Counters.Stun = (absent)
